{"abstract":"This one-day workshop seeks to bring together design researchers that have different orientations and practices for futures and futur- ing to unpack the role of futuring across design, design artefacts, and designers. Our goal in this workshop is to use examples of established futures to engage with and reflect on questions around the role of futures in HCI/design. We believe that there is a common thread between work from many different researchers, but that the people doing that work are spread across different disciplines and geographical locations. To that end, this workshop will assem- ble researchers working with different methods and approaches to futures in design and will aim to identify core challenges and opportunities for futures in HCI.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Jenkins, Tom","Tsaknaki, Vasiliki","Boer, Laurens","Kun, Peter","Howell, Noura","Wong, Richmond","Campo Woytuk, Nadia","Søndergaard, Maria Louise Juul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-759409"],"event":{"acronym":"DIS","title":"ACM Conference on Designing Interactive Systems"},"filters":{"added":"2024-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway","Sweden","United States"],"glorg":["AHO The Oslo School of Architecture and Design, Norway","All Global Affiliations","Georgia Institute of Technology","KTH Royal Institute of Technology"],"keyword":["Design Futuring","Design research","Futures"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mapping futures and futuring in hci design","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/%2010.1145/3656156.3658384","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-759409","identifier":[{"id":"85198906038","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-91abe117-12cd-4c3b-9943-34ab75c4ac66"],"keyword":["design futuring","design research","futures"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5E149DA731F91BC1D38C3C0F1DE88B83"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/105488248/2024_Jenkins_et_al_-_Mapping_Futures_and_Futuring_in_HCI_Design.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/%2010.1145/3656156.3658384","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Climate IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Digital Welfare","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design, Design Research Section","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Interaction Design Research Group","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, IxD Lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"georgia institute of technology","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"se","key":"kth royal institute of technology","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KTH Royal Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"no","key":"aho the oslo school of architecture and design norway","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AHO The Oslo School of Architecture and Design, Norway","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tom","key":"jenkinspau","l