"Ackert-Bicknell, Cheryl L.","rank":86,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"34","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonathan H.","key":"tobiasjonathanhpau","last":"Tobias","name":"Tobias, Jonathan H.","rank":87,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"David M.","key":"evansdavidmpau","last":"Evans","name":"Evans, David M.","rank":88,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Fernando","key":"rivadeneirafernandopau","last":"Rivadeneira","name":"Rivadeneira, Fernando","rank":89,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29304378"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ajhg.2017.12.005","issn":["00029297","15376605"],"issn_org":["00029297"],"issue":"1","journal":"American Journal of Human Genetics","pages":"88-102","publisher":"Cell Press","status":"p","title":"American Journal of Human Genetics","volume":"102"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85039787162"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-262b4c31-0259-4e43-8d7f-ae1cca1fb355","ku-50b5d28d-cfc1-4c2e-a55f-c0ba82023a2e"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Life-Course Genome-wide Association Study Meta-analysis of Total Body BMD and Assessment of Age-Specific Effects","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-033437","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Digital data has a considerable role in our everyday lives: we use publicly available data to find out about weather, traffic or pollution, we track ourselves and we release our private data to monitor our health and to get advices from our favourite apps, we relate on services that digest big amount of data to predict what will happen next. In this era of “living services”, what kind of data literacy is needed to equip a service designer? Is there a need to rethink of service design tools so that data will be explicitly taken into account in the design process? Is there a need to update service design curricula to embrace these challenges? All of these questions will be discussed through a specific case: a workshop on data exploration held at the Service Systems Design Master at Aalborg University in Copenhagen to investigate the role of data literacy in a service design university program.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Götzen, Amalia De","Kun, Peter","Simeone, Luca","Morelli, Nicola"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-109972"],"event":{"acronym":"ServDes","end":"2018-06-20","place":"Milan, it","start":"2018-06-18","title":"Service Design and Innovation Conference","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Delft University of Technology"],"keyword":["Data Literacy","Service Design Education","Service design tools"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"making sense of data in a service design education","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/292661253/ServDes_2018_DataXServiceEdu_Final_1_.pdf","version":"